      "body": "i need help understanding things a bit in the notebooks im going through. in this one for example (and in previous ones), this line takes a long time to run, why is that? tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/1_baseline_template.ipynb\n\n# Inspect a single batch to confirm shapes before training.\nbatch = next(iter(train_data_loader))\nprint({k: (tuple(v.shape) if hasattr(v, \"shape\") else type(v).__name__) for k, v in batch.items()})\n"
